# Prelude to a Storm (WotG 31), Status 2 and Option 2 (GMs): the zone-in plays 22; its finish gives a Vile Elixir (4174)
# and completes the mission (Storm's Crescendo current).
lists XarcabardS/Rally_Point_Red/onTrigger XarcabardS/Rally_Point_Green/onTrigger XarcabardS/onZoneIn/1 XarcabardS/onEventUpdate/22 XarcabardS/onEventFinish/21 XarcabardS/onEventFinish/22 XarcabardS/onEventFinish/25
char zone=XarcabardS pos=-106.071,-25.5,-50 job=WAR lvl=99
mission Asa BurgeoningDread current
mission Acp ACrystallineProphecyFin current
mission Rov ARhapsodyForTheAges current
mission Soa Abomination current
mission Wotg PreludeToAStorm current
charvar Mission[5][30]Status 2
charvar Mission[5][30]Option 2
login open                                 # 22
finish
